<resources>
    <string name="extras_section">Ride extras</string>
    <string name="extras_parking">Where did I park?</string>
    <string name="extras_parking_desc">Remembers where you left the bike when you disconnect from the dash. Shown on the main screen, the home-screen widget and the watch, with walking directions.</string>
    <string name="extras_rain">Rain alert</string>
    <string name="extras_rain_desc">When you connect, checks the forecast for the next 3 hours around you (Open-Meteo, approximate location only) and warns you on the phone and the watch if rain is likely.</string>
    <string name="extras_turns">Turn vibrations on the watch</string>
    <string name="extras_turns_desc">Android Auto navigation buzzes your watch before each manoeuvre: 2 pulses left, 3 right, long + N short for roundabout exit N, two long for a U-turn. Experimental.</string>
    <string name="extras_turns_toast">Applies from the next connection to the dash.</string>
